  "title": "About the Project",
  "content": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-69bbf988 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/\">Home</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/about/\">About the Project</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--2\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/contact/\">Contact</a>\n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-style-section-2 has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained is-style-section-2--3\" style=\"padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">About The Golden Crumb</h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">A fictional cookie shop website built for an <strong>Informática Aplicada a Internet (IAI)</strong> school project. Every page uses WordPress blocks, custom theme styling, and sample content in English.</p>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-c8d96ec6 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/the-golden-crumb-6a0ab271cadc4.png\" alt=\"Cookie display case at The Golden Crumb bakery\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1;object-fit:cover\" /></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Our project story</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Golden Crumb imagines a neighborhood bakery where every cookie is baked in small batches. This site demonstrates clear navigation, visual hierarchy, and accessible content for visitors who want to browse flavors, read our story, and send a message.</p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><li>Home page with menu and customer reviews</li><li>About page explaining the school project</li><li>Contact page with a working inquiry form</li><li>Images and embedded video for richer media</li></ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator alignwide has-alpha-channel-opacity\" />\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Behind the oven</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\">Watch how classic chocolate chip cookies come together — the same cozy process we imagine every morning at The Golden Crumb.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CHWkDExpGWg?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote has-text-align-center is-layout-flow wp-block-quote-is-layout-flow\"><p>Fresh from the oven, one golden crumb at a time.</p><cite>The Golden Crumb team</cite></blockquote>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignwide has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Explore our site</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-69bbf988 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/\">Home</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--4\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/about/\">About the Project</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--5\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/contact/\">Contact</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n",
  "excerpt": "<p>Learn about The Golden Crumb — a warm bakery-style cookie shop website created for an IAI school project.</p>\n"
